# Text Rune compiles in, hashes or runs is LF in every checkout, whatever core.autocrlf says: the
# precompiled shaders are keyed to the WGSL's bytes (crates/rune/build.rs also reads CRLF as LF,
# for checkouts made before this file), and a shell script with CRLF doesn't run.
*.wgsl text eol=lf
*.luau text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.jsonl text eol=lf
*.mmd text eol=lf
*.vert text eol=lf
*.frag text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

# Precompiled shaders and raw pixel data, never converted.
*.dxbc binary
*.metallib binary
*.rgba binary
*.bin binary

# The ledger: parallel branches each append a row, and union keeps both. attn's scripts/rune-bump
# refuses a merge where union kept two versions of one line.
FORK.md merge=union
